{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t政府將於下星期五開始招標出售沙田石門住宅用地，是今季賣地表內推出的唯一一幅地皮，12月18日截標。<br/>\n<br/>\n地皮位於沙田石門大涌橋路與安心街交界，地盤面積約8.63萬平方呎，指定作非工業用途，但不包括倉庫、酒店及加油站；最低及最高樓面面積分別約32.1萬及約53.5萬平方呎。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅煒皓\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T10:39:52.646068+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:08:46+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T13:15:30.869952+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T10:33:20.335621+00:00","content_hash":"6a0d2aece007700f14f7e1ae6e3f7424dcfb3a764033bc888ec55aa8e3130e65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}